{"screen_name": "bg_miso", "file": "bg_miso", "name": "たちばなみんご", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2023983433396219905/jdh7fEKT.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1369264609723514886/1771390211/1500x500", "description": "お絵描き趣味の社会人です。\n色々なジャンル描くけど、ちっちゃくてかわいいのすき。\n\nFAN…DMMのゲームをよくプレイします。\n最近はPSO2NGS復帰しました。９鯖ハガルの民ですよろしくお願いします。\nクリスペもよろしく！　Ship9 「敗者爆散デュエル！」802498 796126\n\nイラストの無断転載、使用は禁止", "total_works": 21, "scraped_works": 21, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T10:24:29.897751+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T10:24:29.897751+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 6000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T10:24:29.897751+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 6000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 6000, "max": 6000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/bg_miso", "name": "bg_miso"}, {"label": "Misskey_io", "url": "https://misskey.io/@bg_miso", "name": "bg_miso"}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/11579048", "name": "11579048"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@bg_miso/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/67699409/uploads/origins/506ec9ee-6485-44a1-a1b1-2ef1d3c4f45a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=387d7e7da3e049e07e0a7041f611f6e7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/67699409/uploads/origins/506ec9ee-6485-44a1-a1b1-2ef1d3c4f45a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=387d7e7da3e049e07e0a7041f611f6e7, https://si.imgix.net/67699409/uploads/origins/506ec9ee-6485-44a1-a1b1-2ef1d3c4f45a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=749fef0eb572b2cee23884dc0bcbe132 2x, https://si.imgix.net/67699409/uploads/origins/506ec9ee-6485-44a1-a1b1-2ef1d3c4f45a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=88ec1801dbd4bb3eb6a1acb4f3ad93cc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "いつもお世話になっております！\n\nまた、たちばなみんごさんにうちのこである\n「でじたん」をお願いしたいと思いま